+ * marionette_awdl_data_tx - root-only switch for AWDL data frames on WMI MGMT_TX
+ *
+ * The exception path (cdp_tx_send_exc) is refused by the firmware with an
+ * unchanging SFR assert, so the only remaining transmit path that the firmware
+ * supports natively is the management-frame one.  cfg80211 normally refuses a
+ * non-management frame before it ever reaches the driver; patch 0043 relaxes
+ * that for the exact Apple AWDL LLC/SNAP prefix.  This switch relaxes the
+ * matching gate inside the P2P component, which is the next thing that
+ * inspects the frame type.
+ *
